export anchor SingleBlueStyle:
    number: 222
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Single blue
    idea: Every colour on the page is a shade of one steel blue, from a pale wash to a near navy rail, with neutral grey text, so hierarchy comes from tone and weight and status from shape.
    base: light
    palette:
        b50: #f3f7fc, the page, fields and the On track chip
        b100: #e2ebf6, the Today panel, empty segments, the chart area and the At risk chip
        b200: #c4d5ec, borders and the focus halo, never text
        b400: #6f97c9, field borders and outlines, never text
        b600: #2d66ad, filled segments, the last week line and icons
        b700: #1f5190, the primary button, current rail item, links, this week line and focus
        b800: #163e6e, the overdue KPI row and blue labels and counts
        b900: #0e2a4b, the rail, headings, the Behind chip and the overdue note
        white: #ffffff, panels and cards
        ink: #1b1f24, body text, the only colour outside the blue family besides ink2
        ink2: #525a63, meta and secondary text
    type:
        One stack, SF Pro Text, Segoe UI, system-ui, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial. The greeting is 26px 700, KPI figures 24px 700
        tabular, panel titles 15px 700, department labels 12px 600 caps,
        body 14px and meta 12px.
    layout:
        An 88px navy rail on the left holds a blue rounded square mark
        and the six nav items as an icon over a small label, the current
        one on a lighter blue tile. The main area has a white header with
        the brand in blue, a wide search, a blue New project button, a
        bell with a navy count and the initials disc with Mara Okafor.
        Below sits a two column board. The left 340px column is a pale
        blue Today panel holding the greeting Hi Mara, here is your
        Saturday with the date, a navy note reading 4 tasks are overdue,
        the four KPIs as a stacked list of white rows with an icon and
        label at left and the figure at right, the overdue row in dark
        blue with white text, and then the activity feed with outlined
        initials discs. The right column holds a white chart panel with
        legend pills, a line chart overlaying the two weeks by weekday,
        this week a solid line with square points and a light area fill,
        last week a dashed line with hollow round points, all values
        labelled, then a projects panel with a two across grid of cards,
        each with a caps department, a status chip, the name, a progress
        bar of twenty segments and a line with percent, tasks and due date
        with days left. Below 1100px the board stacks. Below 760px the
        rail becomes a sticky bottom bar of six icon tabs, cards go one
        across and the chart scrolls sideways.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px gutters and panel padding, 12px between project cards.
    density: Medium. The left Today column carries the summary so the right holds the chart and cards.
    corners: 16px panels, 12px cards and rail items, 10px buttons and fields, and pills for legend chips.
    borders: 1px b200 around panels and cards, and b400 on fields and the secondary button.
    shadows: None. Depth is tone alone, a navy rail, a pale panel and white cards on the wash.
    icons:
        20px line icons at 1.7 to 1.8px stroke. Status uses shape and fill
        weight in blue, an outlined circle with a check on a pale chip, a
        solid triangle with a bang on a mid chip, and an inverted white
        square with a down arrow on a navy chip.
    focus: A 2px b700 outline offset 2px plus a 6px b200 halo, and a white outline on the rail.
    tone: Friendly and plain, such as Hi Mara, here is your Saturday and This week against last.
